  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A fiery piece of shrapnel slams into your hand, lodging in the palm between a couple of the metacarpal bones. Your hand won’t work properly and the fragment is uncomfortably hot!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Your hand is useless (see under Amputated Parts) until the fragment has been removed, which requires an <strong>Average (+20) Heal</strong> Test and the point of a dagger or some other suitable implement to dig it out. Afterwards, one of your fingers may be a little stiff but will work just fine if helpfully strapped to a functional neighboring digit.</p>"
    },
